Package: datasinking
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the DataSinking Full-Text Financial Reports API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("DataSinking", "Team", email = "support@datasink.ing", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin R client for the DataSinking API (<https://datasink.ing>), which
    serves full-text financial reports (annual, semi-annual and quarterly filings) as
    clean, section-addressable Markdown across the US, China, Japan, Korea, Taiwan and
    the UK. Built for reading and RAG pipelines that need the MD&A, risk factors and
    footnotes that line-item APIs do not provide. Requires a (free) API key.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://datasink.ing
Imports:
    httr,
    jsonlite
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
